{{!-- The report of a Share Media submit or a save, on the page it landed on:
      what happened, what already held, and what was refused, each its own
      notice in its own tone. Caller passes `notices` ({ success, info,
      refusal }, each a list of sentences); an empty list draws nothing. --}}
{{#if notices}}
  {{> outcome-notice lines=notices.success tone='ok'}}
  {{> outcome-notice lines=notices.info}}
  {{> outcome-notice lines=notices.refusal tone='no'}}
{{/if}}
